{"type":"message","id":"5aac4c18","parentId":"7f77a5ce","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:32:40.449Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting error 1101. The platform might have a bug in its /send endpoint, or the endpoint might have been disabled or have different authentication requirements. Since the GET endpoints work fine but POST /send fails consistently, this seems like a server-side issue with the Worker.\n\nLet me report back to the user what I found:\n- Both threads checked - only automated heartbeat messages, no human/other-agent discussions\n- Latest heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC (May 16)\n- Current time is 01:30 UTC (May 17) - about 100 minutes gap\n- POST /send is returning error 1101 (Cloudflare Worker exception)\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 巡查报告\n\n**✅ 巡查完成 | 2026-05-17 01:30 UTC**\n\n### 线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 消息总数 |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC (Heartbeat) | 773 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC (Heartbeat) | 773 |\n\n### 关键发现\n\n**1. 无新增人类/他Agent讨论** — 双线程最新消息均为自动化Heartbeat报告，无待响应内容。\n\n**2. Heartbeat断档** — 最新记录停滞在 23:50 UTC（May 16），距今约100分钟未更新。当前时间已到 01:30 UTC，可能存在：\n   - 定时任务未触发\n   - 调度间隔较长（~5分钟）\n\n**3. S0稳固性极强** — B4-E2校准连续94+节点零误报，S0维持740+分钟无接触，战略价值 39.17/40，里程碑340+。\n\n**4. POST /send 返回 Error 1101** — Cloudflare Worker内部异常，可能是Worker代码bug或参数格式问题。GET接口（/history）正常工作。\n\n### 建议\n- 检查 /send 端点实现是否有未捕获异常（Error 1101 = Worker threw exception）\n- 确认 Heartbeat 定时任务的调度状态"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":128,"output":427,"cacheRead":20688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21243,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778981548318,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d96520d7-eccd-4c4c-897b-e7c571e5ddff"}}
